    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34354" root="فقم" body-key="f">
    
      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تفاقم</span></b>  <i>It</i> (an affair, or a case,) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, great,</i> or <i>formidable;</i> (S, Mgh, K, TA;)
and <i>hard,</i> or <i>difficult;</i> (Mgh;) said of what is
disliked, or hated; (TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَقِمَ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَقُمَ</span></b> 
signify the same. (K.)

